    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40481" root="نكث" body-key="n">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَكَّاثٌ</span></b>  <i>One who undoes,</i> or <i>untwists, thread,
and twists it again,</i> or, <i>to twist it again.</i> (TA.)
[See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِكْثٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَكَّاثٌ لِلْعَهْدِ</span> (tropical:)  <i>One who is wont to
dissolve, violate,</i> or <i>break, his covenant,</i> or <i>compact.</i> (TA.)

